  "description": "RS-BYOL is a remote sensing self-supervised learning model based on the BYOL distillation architecture, designed for learning invariant representations from multispectral (MS) and SAR satellite imagery. It supports both single-channel and three-channel feature learning, leveraging multimodal data for improved downstream performance in classification and segmentation tasks.",
